# Only versioned demo inputs belong in images. In particular, never send local
# provider keys, private run databases, virtual environments or model caches.
**
!core/
!core/**
!web/
!web/**
!deploy/
!deploy/demo/
!deploy/demo/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.canopy
**/.venv*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/storybook-static
**/*.sqlite3*
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
